Substitute a for (1):
@divTrunc(a + b - 1, b) * b + @rem(a - 1, b) - b + 1 = @divTrunc(a + b - 1, b) * b - @mod(-a, b)
Yields:
@rem(a - 1, b) - b + 1 = -@mod(-a, b)
=> -@mod(-a, b) = @rem(a - 1, b) - b + 1
=> @mod(-a, b) = -(@rem(a - 1, b) - b + 1) = -@rem(a - 1, b) + b - 1

If @rem(a, b) is not 0:
  @rem(a - 1, b) = @rem(a, b) - 1
  => @mod(-a, b) = -(@rem(a, b) - 1) + b - 1 = -@rem(a, b) + 1 + b - 1 = -@rem(a, b) + b
Else :
  @rem(a - 1, b) = b - 1
  => @mod(-a, b) = -(b - 1) + b - 1 = 0

